# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — EA 系库 release tar 缺 submodule 内共享 CMake 模块（CommonCppFlags）时移除 include ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-19
# Software: eamain 0.0.0-24ca8bf (eastdc/0.0.0-fbcc34e 同款补丁印证)
# Gate: G2/conan create (configure) + W3 本地 CI
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: DRAFT-ea-submodule-commoncppflags-remove
severity: 2
category: build-system|cmake|conan|source
trigger_tool: cmake
phase: configuration
approach: remove-commoncppflags-include-and-let-conan-toolchain-provide-flags
keywords: CommonCppFlags, submodule, CMAKE_MODULE_PATH, include, release tarball, EA, toolchain flags

error_signature: could not find requested file: CommonCppFlags|CMake Error at CMakeLists\.txt:.*\(include\)|include\(CommonCppFlags\)
match_keywords: commoncppflags,cmake_module_path,include(commoncppflags),submodule,release tarball,ea

title: Remove shared .cmake include from EA-family CMakeLists when the module lives in an omitted submodule

root_cause: EA 系库（EAMain/EAStdC 等）顶层 CMakeLists 通过 CMAKE_MODULE_PATH 指向
  test/packages/<dep>/scripts/CMake 再 include(CommonCppFlags)；该模块只在 git submodule
  检出时存在，官方 codeload release tar 不含 submodule 内容，configure 阶段直接报
  include 找不到。CommonCppFlags 仅设置编译标志，与 Conan toolchain 提供的等价项重复。
affected_scope: EA 系基于 submodule 共享 CMake 模块的项目在 OHOS Conan 交叉编译；
  任何 release tar 不含 test/packages 子模块的 EA 仓库

verification_cmd: "conan create <archive> -pr:h=<ohos-profile> --build=missing && cmake configure 通过 && libEAMain.a 构建成功"

rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: "移除 include(CommonCppFlags) 与 CMAKE_MODULE_PATH 指向（补丁 0001）；等价编译标志由 Conan toolchain（CMakeToolchain + CMAKE_CXX_FLAGS 依赖注入）提供"
rec_description: "不需要下载 submodule（E150 方案，unpinned 且非确定性）；直接删除对缺失模块的引用，标志等价项交给 toolchain"
rec_command: "patch 0001-remove-submodule-commoncppflags.patch：删除 set(CMAKE_MODULE_PATH ...)/include(CommonCppFlags) 两行"
rec_auto_fix: true

similar_to: "E150（submodule missing）触发面部分重叠但方案不同（E150=manual-download，本候选=移除 include）；DRAFT-release-tarball-missing-cmake-submodule（header-only 直打包，非编译型库）"
conflicts_with: "E150 的 manual-download 方案——本库场景无需下载，删除引用即可"
